{"recordId":"minister_嚴世蕃_1990553607","name":"嚴世蕃","type":"minister","dynasty":"明朝","title":"權相代筆","canonicalName":null,"aliases":[],"identityStatus":"candidate","candidatePages":[{"title":"嚴世蕃","pageId":266320,"revisionId":93793838,"revisionTimestamp":"2026-08-06T15:11:42Z","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%9A%B4%E4%B8%96%E8%95%83","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93793838","wikidataId":"Q10924350","isDisambiguation":false,"bibliography":[{"citationTitle":"明史·奸臣傳","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"大明世宗肅皇帝實錄","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"}],"wikisourceLinks":[],"retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:39:04.878Z","attribution":{"source":"Chinese Wikipedia contributors","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0; bibliography metadata only","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","status":"candidate index, not independently verified evidence"}}],"sourceIds":["source:mingshi"],"reviewIds":[],"claimIds":[],"matches":[{"documentId":"document:mingshi-a482580fab6cfce0","query":"嚴世蕃","count":1,"offset":6719,"excerpt":"\n\n　　四十四年春三月丁巳，賜范應期等進士及第、出身有差。己未，袁煒致仕。辛酉，嚴世蕃伏誅。是月，土蠻犯遼東，都指揮線補袞、楊維藩戰死。\n\n　　夏四月庚辰，吏部尚書嚴訥、禮部尚書李春芳並兼武英殿大學士，預機務。壬午，俺答犯肅州，總兵官劉承業禦卻之","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:mingshi-696769af46727cd8","query":"嚴世蕃","count":1,"offset":6890,"excerpt":"，王歲時不得燕見。常祿外，例有給賜，王亦不敢請。積三歲，邸中窘甚。王左右以千金賄嚴世蕃，世蕃喜，以屬戶部，得並給三歲資。然世蕃常自疑，一日屏人語以勤及高拱曰：「聞殿下近有惑誌，謂家大人何？」拱故為謔語，以勤正色曰：「國本默定久矣。生而命名，從後從","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:mingshi-6c87473b09b48eba","query":"嚴世蕃","count":1,"offset":10448,"excerpt":"。湖廣兵亦破擒首惡李通海等。岳以黑苗未獲，不敢報功。已而冉元謀露，嶽發其奸。元賄嚴世蕃責岳絶苗黨。邦憲竟得黑苗以獻，苗患乃息。\n\n岳卒於沅州。喪歸，沅人迎哭者不絶。已，敘功，復右都御史，贈太子少保，諡襄惠。\n\n岳博覽，工文章，經術湛深，不喜王守仁","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:mingshi-5ef82964f49bcd9b","query":"嚴世蕃","count":4,"offset":3937,"excerpt":"徐養正、巴縣劉起宗、章丘劉祿合疏言：「兩淮副使張祿遣使入都，廣通結納。如太常少卿嚴世蕃、府丞胡奎等，皆承賂受囑有證。世蕃竊弄父權，嗜賄張焰。」詞連倉場尚書王暐。嵩上疏自理，且求援於中官以激帝怒。帝責其代杲解釋，命廷杖汝進八十，余六十，並謫雲南、廣","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:mingshi-9a89a85ebe33293b","query":"嚴世蕃","count":1,"offset":2306,"excerpt":"則委罪大猷縱賊以自解。帝怒，逮系詔獄，再奪世廕。\n\n　　陸炳與大猷善，密以己資投嚴世蕃解其獄，令立功塞上。大同巡撫李文進習其才，與籌軍事。乃造獨輪車拒敵馬。嘗以車百輛，步騎三千，大挫敵安銀堡。文進上其制於朝，遂置兵車營。京營有兵車，自此始也。文進","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:mingshi-ca3c0750c8bc636c","query":"嚴世蕃","count":1,"offset":7642,"excerpt":"移便地就養，終臣餘年。」不許。其明年，南京御史林潤奏：「江洋巨盜多入逃軍羅龍文、嚴世蕃家。龍文居深山，乘軒衣蟒，有負險不臣之志。世蕃得罪後，與龍文日誹謗時政。其治第役眾四千，道路皆言兩人通倭，變且不測。」詔下潤逮捕，下法司論斬，皆伏誅，黜嵩及諸孫","matchType":"name-occurrence"}],"matchCount":6,"gaps":["身份連結尚未完成編輯核對；同名、異名或同時代關係可能有誤配。","原人物分析及能力數值尚未逐句核對。","來源中的年代、關係與評價仍需逐條轉成有出處的主張。"],"notes":["姓名／重新導向命中，人物身份與每條書目尚須逐項核對。","姓名、分類、時代及稱號保留原庫資料，不自動視為史實。"],"version":"b66c5a60a41e2334","matchedDocuments":[{"id":"document:mingshi-a482580fab6cfce0","bookId":"book:mingshi","requestedTitle":"明史/卷18","title":"明史/卷18","sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%98%8E%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B718","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2594633","historyUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%98%8E%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B718?action=history","revisionId":2594633,"revisionTimestamp":"2025-08-30T13:20:31Z","retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:58:10.669Z","sha256":"76374cae0a5a1a03aa2c6fd2f1c75a914f8abbe319ad4fe6abe5bdf5fab03127","textSha256":"ed1278c513f19573ee2c4dc36389c558483a8a4c2114bbc97835f7f80046459e","expandedWikitextSha256":"76374cae0a5a1a03aa2c6fd2f1c75a914f8abbe319ad4fe6abe5bdf5fab03127","characters":7363,"contentPath":"/static/data/history/archive-books/mingshi.json","status":"downloaded","acquisitionStatus":"downloaded","reuse":"Ancient underlying text; Wikisource transcription attribution and CC BY-SA 4.0 for applicable contributions","extraction":"wikitext-conservative-v2.1.0","normalizedAt":"2026-10-02T11:14:44.945Z","upstreamTextQuality":null,"upstreamTextQualityMeaning":"Wikisource platform quality marker; not a percentage of text transcribed","